{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1029510001:1":{"text":"Thank you for saving my family...","source_cn":"感谢你们，及时救了我的亲人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CFE3568EF7736D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029510002:1":{"text":"Dura above, thank heavens the child and elderly weren't injured!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，孩子与老人没有受伤就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6CBBF9B9BCA803B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029510003:0":{"text":"I don't know how to thank you enough!","source_cn":"真是不知道要怎么感谢你们才好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824DC83AF6399605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029510004:1":{"text":"Father, they're here on the trail of Nakalig's legendary treasure. Do you still remember the bedtime stories you used to tell me?","source_cn":"父亲，他们是为了追寻月神宝藏的传说而来，你还记得给我小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0C65ABFD5057D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029510005:1":{"text":"Ah, I see. So you're here to search for the moon god's treasure, eh?","source_cn":"原来如此，各位大人是来寻找月神宝藏的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4285757CE99535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1029510005":{"text":"Ah, I see. So you're here to search for the moon god's treasure, eh?","source_cn":"原来如此，各位大人是来寻找月神宝藏的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4285757CE99535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029510006:3":{"text":"Is it a bedtime story?! I wanna eat fruit and listen to Grandpa!","source_cn":"是睡前故事吗？妈妈，我想一边吃赤珠果一边听外公讲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFE9C29ABDDB22A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029510007:1":{"text":"Alright, then, I'll tell it. The legend of the moon god's treasure has been passed down through the generations.","source_cn":"好吧好吧，我这就讲。月神的宝藏，是我们祖辈留下的一个传...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0A3F308A6889C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029510008:1":{"text":"It's said that Nakalig placed his precious items in a spring that could be illuminated by moonlight.","source_cn":"传说月神把自己的珍贵之物，放入了可以被月光照亮的泉水之中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E013582BB3BD178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029510009:1":{"text":"But he feared that others would desire his treasures if they shone too brightly in the dark.","source_cn":"但他担心自己珍贵之物在黑夜中太过耀眼，会被他人觊觎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A1888BF31876DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029510010:1":{"text":"So he covered up the spring, which could only be awakened by solving his puzzle.","source_cn":"于是他将泉眼掩盖起来，只有解开他的谜题才能唤起泉眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA807937C5F5E60C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029510011:1":{"text":"A divine puzzle? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, could that be related to the mechanism we saw near the spring?","source_cn":"神的谜题嘛？<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF31EA7910455D29A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A divine puzzle? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, could that be related to the mechanism we saw near the spring?","female":"A divine puzzle? <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, could that be related to the mechanism we saw near the spring?","variant_male_record_index":"117054","variant_female_record_index":"117055","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029510012:1":{"text":"If there's anything more to it, I wouldn't know!","source_cn":"再多的东西，我也不知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB1E4B1859BCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1029510012":{"text":"If there's anything more to it, I wouldn't know!","source_cn":"再多的东西，我也不知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CB1E4B1859BCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029510013:1":{"text":"Good luck to you!","source_cn":"祝你们好运！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16AFC9B97A6B027B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"Thanks for the lead.","source_cn":"谢谢你的提示","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1DAF99357184B621","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Thanks for the lead.","female":"Thanks for the lead.","variant_male_record_index":"62784","variant_female_record_index":"62785","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:1:2":{"text":"We'll finish the story.","source_cn":"谢谢你的故事","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC3A0250837008CD4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We'll finish the story.","female":"We'll finish the story.","variant_male_record_index":"62786","variant_female_record_index":"62787","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"We heard some legends.","source_cn":"听闻了一些传说。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE7B45482559DB1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We heard some legends.","female":"We heard some legends.","variant_male_record_index":"62780","variant_fem